DESCRIPTION:Your favorite conference’s favorite conference is BACK for its
  second run!💖 Please join QSU\, QSIH\, oSTEM\, Out@Kelley\, and BLAQ for
  the ✨O.A.S.I.S. Conference✨ on ⌚️April 11th\, 2026 from 9am to 4pm in 📍
 Walnut Grove C100. We are excited to offer workshops and panels on interv
 iewing essentials\, queer professionalism\, LGBTQ+ patient/provider advoc
 acy\, on-campus activism\, and highlighting black queer visibility! We al
 so are offering an opportunity for queer researchers to share their resea
 rch through a poster with everyone\, along with networking opportunities!
  \n🌊To attend\, please RSVP to this event by April 1st using the QR code
  or this link: https://forms.gle/CHsEhYoAhFw7ratY8. \n🌊To sign-up for pr
 esenting your research\, please fill out this form ASAP by April 1st\, as
  limited spots are available: https://forms.gle/QQZyW61rUAYxEtcc6\n🌊And 
 did we mention free food and merch? \nPlease reach out if you have any qu
 estions\, and we hope to see you there!🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️\n\nHosted by: Out at 
 Kelley\, oSTEM at Indiana University Bloomington\, Queer Student Union\, 
 Queer Students in Healthcare at IU\n\nAdditional Information can be found
  at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12321313
