 ta-start="251">  If you're a lover of whimsy\, wonder\, and woodland fant
 asy aesthetics\, this event promises an evening filled with music\, encha
 ntment\, and the chance to mingle with other radiant\, ethereal souls in 
 a space where everyone can be mystical royalty.</p><p data-end="768" data
 -start="498">  Step into a realm of twinkling lights\, lush greenery\, an
 d otherworldly charm as you dance the night away and live out your enchan
 ted fairytale dreams. Everyone is invited to find their moment of magic i
 n a night where community\, imagination\, and queer joy reign supreme.</p
 ><p data-is-only-node="" data-is-last-node="" data-end="903" data-start="
 770">  Dress to impress in your most spellbinding attire and prepare to b
