DESCRIPTION:Join Union Board Films in the Whittenberger Auditorium to watc
 h the Life Aquatic with Steve Zissou. This film follows renowned oceanogr
 apher Steve Zissou (Bill Murray) who has sworn vengeance upon the rare sh
 ark that devoured a member of his crew. In addition to his regular team\,
  he is joined on his boat by Ned (Owen Wilson)\, a man who believes Zisso
 u to be his father\, and Jane (Cate Blanchett)\, a journalist pregnant by
  a married man. They travel the sea\, all too often running into pirates 
 and\, perhaps more traumatically\, various figures from Zissou's past\, i
 ncluding his estranged wife\, Eleanor (Anjelica Huston).\n\nHosted by: In
 diana Memorial Union Board\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12405323
