  Crocs professionals\, add a project to your resume or portfolio\, and be
  entered to win prizes.⭐️ In addition to the national competition\, a
  top Indiana University student will be able to design their own Crocs Ji
 bbitz\, and Crocs will produce 100 for them to share! ⭐️Join the Kick
 -off event at 5pm EST to meet the Crocs team and get briefed on the chall
 enge.
