CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Campus-Wide Event
DESCRIPTION:SAATH and U Bring Change 2 Mind are hosting a Live Word Cloud 
 event during the week of 30th. Tables will be set up across campus during
  lunchtime (around 11–2) in high-traffic areas like Ballantine\, IMU\, Ne
 al Marshall\, and other central locations. At each table\, students can s
 can a QR code and respond to a simple mental health check-in question wit
 h one word.\nAs responses come in\, they’ll build a live word cloud that 
 reflects the real-time emotional landscape of our campus. Reps will also 
 share wellness flyers highlighting IU mental health resources\, including
  CAPS. By the end of the event\, we’ll have a collective piece of art mad
 e up of students’ voices! This can become a visual reminder that no one i
 s alone in how they’re feeling.\n\nHosted by: U Bring Change to Mind\, WE
  ARE SAATH at Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12414224
DTEND:20260414T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T143034Z
DTSTART:20260413T220000Z
GEO:39.173520;-86.512400
LOCATION:Student Recreational Sports Center
