DTSTART:20260414T160000Z
DTEND:20260414T170000Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW - Room Number: 121
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:First Gen Women in the Law
DESCRIPTION:Join the First-Generation Law Association (FGLA) and the Wome
 n's Law Caucus (WLC)&#160\; for a special event celebrating the achieveme
 nts and experiences of first-generation women in the legal profession.&#1
 60\;  This panel features a group of distinguished Maurer alumnae who wil
 l share their unique perspectives as first-generation women in the legal 
 profession. Panelists will discuss the personal and professional challeng
 es they have navigated\, the victories they have achieved\, and the valua
 ble lessons learned throughout their journeys. This event offers an insig
 htful opportunity for students to learn about building a resilient legal 
 career and overcoming obstacles as first-generation practitioners.  Guest
  Speakers:Samantha Lalisan\, Maurer 2019  Cheyna (Haas) Galloway\, Maurer
  2021  Katherine Bingaman\, Maurer 2024  Barbara Bernal Monrroy\, Maurer 
 2025
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the First-Generation Law Associati
 on (FGLA) and the Women's Law Caucus (WLC)&#160\; for a special event cel
 ebrating the achievements and experiences of first-generation women in th
 e legal profession.&#160\;</p><p>  This panel features a group of disting
 uished Maurer alumnae who will share their unique perspectives as first-g
 eneration women in the legal profession. Panelists will discuss the perso
 nal and professional challenges they have navigated\, the victories they 
 have achieved\, and the valuable lessons learned throughout their journey
 s. This event offers an insightful opportunity for students to learn abou
 t building a resilient legal career and overcoming obstacles as first-gen
 eration practitioners.</p><p>  Guest Speakers:</p><ul><li>Samantha Lalisa
 n\, Maurer 2019  </li><li>Cheyna (Haas) Galloway\, Maurer 2021  </li><li>
 Katherine Bingaman\, Maurer 2024  </li><li>Barbara Bernal Monrroy\, Maure
 r 2025  </li></ul>
