X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION: \n\nThe Community Thread \n\n \n\n\nThe Activity: Set up a la
 rge foam board with several categories pinned to the edges (e.g.\, "First
  Gen\," "Business Major\," "Out of State\," "Multilingual\," "Artist").\n
 The DEI Twist: People grab a piece of colorful yarn and tie it to every p
 in that describes them.\nThe Result: Over time\, the board becomes a gian
 t\, tangled\, beautiful web showing that even though we have different id
 entities\, we are all physically connected to the same community.\n\n\n\n
