DESCRIPTION:Get ready to sweat\, dance\, and have a blast! On Wednesday\, 
 April 15\, 2026\, Union Board Mind & Body is teaming up with Pulse Dance 
 Club to bring you Move & Groove – Hip Hop Cardio Class\, a high-energy\, 
 one-hour hip hop cardio workout in Alumni Hall. Led by members of Pulse D
 ance Club\, this class is designed for all levels\, whether you're a seas
 oned dancer or just someone who loves moving their body\, everyone is wel
 come on the dance floor. We encourage you to please RSVP before the event
 . \nJoin us from 7:00–8:00 PM to take a break from the stress of the week
 \, let loose\, and get your heart pumping to some great music. This is th
 e perfect opportunity to step away from the books\, have some fun\, and e
 nd your Wednesday night on a high note. Snacks and refreshments will be p
 rovided\, so all you have to do is show up and move!\nAll Indiana Univers
 ity events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and histo
 rical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indian
 a University community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\, Puls
 e Dance Club\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolve
 d.indiana.edu/event/12314888
DTEND:20260416T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T143034Z
DTSTART:20260415T230000Z
LOCATION:Alumni Hall
SEQUENCE:0
