SUMMARY:African Studies Program Student Awards & Spring Reception 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join the African Studies Program for our annual Spring Recept
 ion and Student Awards Ceremony.  This special event recognizes academic 
 excellence\, leadership\, and contributions to the field of African Studi
 es. Awards presented will include the Carleton T. Hodge Award\, the Patri
 ck O'Meara Travel Award\, and additional honors recognizing student achie
 vement and engagement.  We warmly invite faculty\, students\, staff\, and
  members of the broader community to attend and help us celebrate the acc
 omplishments of our students.Date: Thursday\, April 16\, 2026Time: 5:00 
  6:30 p.m.Location: Atrium\, Hamilton Lugar School (GA/GISB)\, 355 N Ea
 gleson Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47405  Light refreshments will be served.
