DESCRIPTION:The 12th Annual Indiana University International Conference on
  Africa\, themed “Africa\, Reflect!”\, will take place April 17–19\, 2026
 \, in a hybrid format combining in-person sessions at Indiana University 
 Bloomington with virtual participation via Zoom. The conference will brin
 g together scholars\, practitioners\, and artists\, and students to engag
 e in transdisciplinary reflections on Africa’s past\, present\, and futur
 e amid rapidly shifting global dynamics. We're expecting about 85 people 
  for the two days of the event.\n\nHosted by: African Languages and Cultu
 res Club\, Graduate Students in African Studies\n\nAdditional Information
  can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12363995
