DESCRIPTION:The event will be an outdoor event\, focused on bringing toget
 her friends and family to celebrate the new year. It will be open to all 
 students and staff who wish to celebrate the beautiful culture of myanmar
 . The water festival will include food\, music\, and performances from st
 udent groups. The festival will emphasize the use of water with water gun
 s\, water balloons\, and decorations to allow for a replication of their 
 home.\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educatio
 nal\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and o
 ther members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana M
 emorial Union Board\, Myanmar Student Association at Indiana University\n
 \nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/
 event/12401026
