DESCRIPTION:Phi Alpha Delta is hosting its 10th Annual Benefit Gala for In
 diana Legal Services. This will be hosted in the Tudor Room at the Indian
 a Memorial Union from 5:30-9 PM on April 17\, 2026. We will have a catere
 d dinner as well as speakers from ILS and the legal field and a silent au
 ction with many items from local businesses. This event will consist of n
 etworking with legal personnel as well as raising many funds for ILS to s
 upport their mission to help people who cannot afford attorneys to be abl
 e to receive them free of charge and serve justice across the state of In
 diana.\n\nHosted by: Phi Alpha Delta Law Pre-Law Fraternity\, Internation
 al\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.
 edu/event/12333759
