DESCRIPTION:The program would involve live music and performances from fiv
 e bands in the Harmony School Gymnasium. It is meant as a way for Live fr
 om Bloomington to branch into community based venues and involve spaces t
 hat those who enjoy live music feel more comfortable in. As well as this\
 , providing a promising venue for local bands. With all of this\, there i
 s a philanthropic goal of getting attendees to donate canned goods to hoo
 sier hills food bank during the event. Specific Details on the event is w
 e need space to include the names of five bands on the graphic.\n \nAll I
 ndiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultur
 al\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and other members
  of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Unio
 n Board\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.ind
