DESCRIPTION:Join Hindu YUVA for a guest speaker event on April 18th featur
 ing Srikant Ji Basarkod. This session is a chance to learn more about Hin
 duism and understand the actual rituals and philosophy behind our traditi
 ons.\nThe event will include a talk by our guest speaker followed by a Q&
 A session. It is a great opportunity to ask questions\, dive deeper into 
 the spiritual side of our faith\, and connect with other members of our c
 ommunity.\nLight food will be served at the end. This event is free and o
 pen to all students. We hope to see you there!\n\nHosted by: Hindu YUVA a
 t Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://b
 einvolved.indiana.edu/event/12410308
