CATEGORIES:Film/Movie
CATEGORIES:Campus-Wide Event
DESCRIPTION:Join Union Board Films in watching the new hit movie\, with Ti
 mothée Chalamet\, Marty Supreme. Set in 1950s New York\, Marty Supreme (2
 025) follows Marty Mauser (Timothée Chalamet)\, a scrappy table tennis hu
 stler with an iron belief in his own greatness that nobody else shares. D
 riven by obsession and a relentless hunger for self-invention\, Marty cla
 ws his way from the fringes of the sport toward the top\, but at a steep 
 personal cost. Directed by Josh Safdie and released by A24\, it's a kinet
 ic\, darkly funny portrait of ambition\, ego\, and the fine line between 
 confidence and delusion.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/even
 t/12413027
