DESCRIPTION:The Car Club at Indiana University is requesting approval to h
 ost a car meet at Showalter Fountain. This event will provide an organize
 d space for students and community members to view vehicles and engage wi
 th peers who share an interest in automobiles.\nAll participating vehicle
 s will be pre-registered and approved in advance. The club will provide a
  parking map designating where cars will be parked around the fountain to
  ensure proper flow\, safety\, and accessibility. Only registered partici
 pants will be allowed to display their cars.\nThe event will also include
  food and non-alcoholic beverages\, provided in compliance with universit
 y policies. The IU Car Club has successfully hosted this event in the pas
 t\, and we will oversee logistics\, setup\, and cleanup to ensure the are
 a is well-managed and returned to its original condition.\nThis gathering
  is designed to foster community\, promote student involvement\, and high
 light the responsible and collaborative nature of our organization.\n\nHo
 sted by: The Car Club at Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can
  be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12418439
DTEND:20260419T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T143034Z
