SUMMARY: Duruflé’s Requiem
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Chamber Singers to offer Duruflé’s Majestic Requi
 em\n\nBloomington\, Indiana\, 4 April 2026\n\nRounding out the Bloomingto
 n Chamber Singers regular season will be Duruflé’s 1947 Requiem.\n\nPayin
 g homage to early French liturgical chant\, Duruflé’s Requiem haunting se
 tting of the requiem\n\nmass allows the listener to be transported beyond
  the centuries with the merging of ancient melodies\n\nwith mid-20th cent
 ury sacred tones. This amalgamation of ancient line with the postwar musi
 cality\n\ncreates a unique and lasting impression on the listener\, wheth
 er encountering the work for the first or\n\nthe fortieth time.\n\nIn add
 ition to the Requiem\, audience members will be treated to a French madri
 gal Tourdion (Quand\n\nje bois du vin clairet) as an acapella processiona
 l. The light-hearted\, frolicking madrigal provides a\n\nwonderful juxtap
 osition to the sacred sincerity of the beloved Requiem Mass.\n\nThe eveni
 ng’s program\, conducted by artistic director\, Caio Guimarães\, will be 
 presented at St.\n\nMark’s United Methodist Church\, 100 N st. R. 46\, Bl
 oomington. The presentation will begin at 4:00\n\npm. In-person tickets a
 re available either through pre-sale or at the door. A live-stream option
  is also\n\navailable. General admission tickets for the concert are $20 
 or $15 for students. Additional\n\ninformation is available at http://www
 .chambersingers.info.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Music,Bloomington
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/62fb9509b27fd5
 06428328ed/69d9a138cef9e1612c5d20b1/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Bloomington Chamber Singers to offer Duruflé’s Majes
 tic Requiem Bloomington\, Indiana\, 4 April 2026 Rounding out the Bloomin
 gton Chamber Singers regular...
LOCATION:St Marks United Methodist Church\,100 Indiana 46\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47408\, USA
CREATED:20260411T011746Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T015430Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T011746Z
