CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:We host educational workshops\, general meetings\, community a
 nd social events\, and professional development events. Our educational w
 orkshops raise awareness of important current events. General meetings gi
 ve all members a chance to connect. Community events allow us to make a p
