 \, Haizhen Lin\, and Don Kuratko</p><p>  This panel is open to all intere
 sted faculty members\, particularly those who have achieved tenure. It wi
 ll offer the opportunity to engage with senior faculty to discuss paths t
 oward advancing your research impact and leadership in the field while al
 so navigating service to the school and your discipline. Topics include\,
  but are not limited to\, having an impact on local\, federal\, or intern
 ational policy\; serving in leadership roles within the field\; becoming 
 Editor-in-Chief\; writing a book.</p>
