  Trust will give away more than 800 free native tree seedlings. One free tr
 ee seedling per person while supplies last.\n\nAvailable species: elderberr
 y\, eastern redbud\, persimmon\, gray dogwood\, ninebark\, and red oak.\n\n
 Tree seedlings were grown by the Indiana Department of Natural Resources.\n
 \nThis event takes place simultaneously at two Bloomingfoods locations:\n- 
 Bloomingfoods East: 3220 E. 3rd St.\n- Bloomingfoods Near West: 316 W. 6th 
 St.\n\nSponsored by IU Health. Co-hosted by Bloomingfoods Co-op Market.\n\n
