  pad area at Switchyard Park for a 1:00pm departure.<br><br>Nice 'n' Easy r
 ides cater to those who want to take it easy and to less experienced riders
 .  These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and slower paces 
 than Saturday touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low traffic roads.<
