DESCRIPTION:The WGBA 2026 Gala is an end-of-year celebration hosted by the
  Women’s Graduate Business Association at Indiana University. This event 
 will bring together WGBA members\, Kelley graduate students\, faculty\, a
 nd invited guests to celebrate the accomplishments of the academic year\,
  recognize outstanding student leaders\, and foster community among gradu
 ate business students.\nThe event will include brief remarks from WGBA le
 adership\, a guest speaker from the business community\, presentation of 
 leadership awards\, dinner and refreshments\, and social time with music 
 and dancing.\n\nHosted by: Women's Graduate Business Association\n\nAddit
 ional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/1
 2302325
