 yard Plaza Spray Pad at Switchyard Park</u></a></p></h3><h3>General Admissi
 on</h3><ul><li>Daily admission $7/person. Ages 4 yrs. and younger admitted 
 at no charge.</li><li>Bryan Park Pool Morning Lap Swim (M\, F\, and Sa from
