 rice when pool opens at 11 a.m.</li><li><em><strong>There are no admission 
 refunds for unscheduled pool closings\, including closings due to emergenci
 es\, contamination\, or weather conditions. Season Passes and Economy 20-Pu
 nch Passes are non-refundable.</strong></em></li></ul>
