X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Eskenazi Museum of Art": "https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2180114-parents-afternoon-in-at-the-eskenazi-museum-of-art"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Eskenazi Museum of Art": "https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2177103-parents-afternoon-in-at-the-eskenazi-museum-of-art"}
X-SOURCE-ID:iu_eskenazi_museum
X-SOURCE:Eskenazi Museum of Art
DTSTART:20260531T160000Z
DTEND:20260531T180000Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:Parents' Afternoon In at the Eskenazi Museum of Art
DESCRIPTION:Parents' Afternoon In offers a unique opportunity to enjoy th
 e museum with separate parallel programming that supports creativity\, an
 d relaxation. Kids will have the opportunity to engage with art while par
 ents relax with a variety of activities.  K-12 Children's Program12:00–
 12:30 PM: Guided gallery exploration.  12:30–2:00 PM: Hands-on art acti
 vity in the art studio + snack.  Adult Program12:00–1:00 PM: Experience
  select galleries through a fun and casual guided experience.  1:00–2:0
 0 PM: Choose your own adventure: relax with art-filled coloring sheets\, 
 have a snack from the museum cafe or explore more of the galleries at you
 r leisure.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div id="lw_cal_event_detail_description" cl
 ass="lw_cal_event_detail_block"><p><em>Parents' Afternoon In</em> offers 
 a unique opportunity to enjoy the museum with separate parallel programmi
 ng that supports creativity\, and relaxation. Kids will have the opportun
 ity to engage with art while parents relax with a variety of activities. 
  </p><p><strong>K-12 Children's Program</strong></p><p><strong>12:00–12
 :30 PM:</strong> Guided gallery exploration.  </p><p><strong>12:30–2:00
  PM:</strong> Hands-on art activity in the art studio + snack.  </p><p><s
 trong>Adult Program</strong></p><p><strong>12:00–1:00 PM:</strong> Expe
 rience select galleries through a fun and casual guided experience.  </p>
 <p><strong>1:00–2:00 PM:</strong> Choose your own adventure: relax with
  art-filled coloring sheets\, have a snack from the museum cafe or explor
 e more of the galleries at your leisure.  </p></div>
