SUMMARY:Preserve-a-Preserve Weed Wrangle at Tangeman Woods
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260702T100000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260702T120000
UID:53a6abcc1e20d6fa23f01fab5713c517@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Join Saige Sentell\, Sycamore Land Trust&#8217\;s new Educatio
 n Director\, on her first Preserve-a-Preserve Weed Wrangle at Tangeman Woo
 ds in Bartholomew County! Volunteers will have the opportunity to learn in
 vasive plant identification and management\, basic herbicide safety\, and 
