SUMMARY:Preserve-a-Preserve Volunteer Weed Wrangle at Downey Hill
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260721T090000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260721T113000
UID:d6dde0dc6adc78937c097718f0f0e7c4@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Volunteers are invited to help Sycamore preserve native biodiv
 ersity\, gain hands-on experience in land stewardship\, and help maintain 
 natural areas at our preserves! Weed Wrangle events are fun and educationa
 l opportunities to learn how to identify and control the invasive plants t
 hat are negatively impacting our preserves and other green spaces in our c
 ommunity. The focus for this work day will be the identification and contr
 ol of woody invasive plants.
LOCATION:The Laura Hare Nature Preserve at Downey Hill
URL:https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2023/07/preserve-a-preserve-volunteer-we
 ed-wrangle-at-downey-hill/
X-SOURCE:Sycamore Land Trust
END:VEVENT
