DESCRIPTION:15th Annual Dinner on the Medora Covered Bridge\nHosted by Frie
 nds of Medora Covered Bridge\n\nJoin us for a memorable evening dining on t
 he historic Medora Covered Bridge — the longest covered bridge in the US\, 
 just a short drive from Bloomington!\n\nMENU (provided by Cedar Hill Cateri
 ng):\n• Almond Baked Chicken or Slow Cooker Roast Beef\n• Spring mix salad 
 with strawberries\, oranges\, almonds and raspberries\n• Homemade cheese po
 tatoes\, green beans\, homemade bread & rolls\n• Lemonade\, Iced Tea and Wa
 ter\n\nENTERTAINMENT: Jerry and Amber Henson (live music)\nDoor prize givea
 ways throughout the evening.\n\nTICKETS: $35.00 each | Limited to 200 guest
 s\nAvailable at:\n• Jackson County Visitor Center\n• State Bank of Medora\n
 • Friends of Medora Covered Bridge on Facebook\n• Online: https://www.medor
 acoveredbridge.org/events\n• Ticketleap: https://www.ticketleap.events/tick
 ets/friend-1105823926/15th-annual-dinner-on-the-bridge (online service fees
  apply)\n\nContact: Nick Walden | medora.art@gmail.com | 812-498-6298
