 li><li>Pool is closed Tuesday\, Aug. 4 through Friday\, Aug. 7.</li><li>Ope
 n Saturday and Sunday only beginning Saturday\, Aug. 8 and ending Monday\, 
 Sept. 7 (Labor Day). Pool is open Sept. 7.</li></ul><p>Operating hours are 
 subject to change. The pool\, or portions of the pool\, may close due to li
 feguard shortages\, low attendance\, or threatening weather. For updates on
  hours of operation or the open status of Bryan Park Pool and Mills Pool\, 
 <a><u><u>call the Splash &amp\; Skate Hotline</u></u></a> (812-349-3741).</
 p><h3><b>General Admission</b></h3><ul><li>Daily admission $7/person. Ages 
 4 yrs. and younger admitted at no charge.</li><li>Bryan Park Pool Morning L
 ap Swim (M\, F\, and Sa from 10-11 a.m.) admission $5/person. Lap swimmers 
 must pay regular admission price when pool opens at 11 a.m.</li></ul>
