CREATED:20260409T151542Z
DESCRIPTION:At the Willie Streeter Community Garden at Winslow Woods Park.<
 br>Registration required\; $10/person.<br>Register by Aug. 10 at <a href="h
 ttps://webtrac.bloomington.in.gov/webtrac/web/search.html?Primarycode=26520
 2" target="_blank"><u>https://webtrac.bloomington.in.gov/webtrac/web/search
 .html?Primarycode=265202</u></a><br>Imagine having a food garden that comes
  back each year without having to be planted in the spring. In this program
  we will review how to establish and care for some of the most delicious ga
 rden favorites including strawberries\, asparagus and rhubarb\, as well as 
 those that will reliably reseed each year. Take the work out of spring gard
 ening by establishing perennial garden plants now.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T151543Z
LOCATION:Willie Streeter Community Gardens\, 2125 S Highland Ave\, Blooming
 ton\, IN 47401\, USA
