 n May 23-Aug. 3\, 2026.</li><li>Operating hours are 11 a.m.-7 p.m. daily.</
 li><li>Pool is closed Tuesday\, Aug. 4 through Friday\, Aug. 7.</li><li>Ope
 n Saturday and Sunday only beginning Saturday\, Aug. 8 and ending Monday\, 
 Sept. 7 (Labor Day). Pool is open Sept. 7.</li></ul><p>Operating hours are 
