UID:0bd9fc4c58c9e98772d4b0068c2ecd73@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Help Sycamore preserve native biodiversity\, gain hands-on exp
 erience in land stewardship\, and help maintain natural areas at our prese
 rves! Weed Wrangle events are fun and educational opportunities to learn h
 ow to identify and control the invasive plants that are negatively impacti
 ng our preserves and other green spaces in our community. The focus for th
 is work day will be the identification and control of woody invasive plant
 s. Registration is required due to limited parking availability.
