UID:c3fd7fc052f5e48934f2d9b2f99996f6@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Join naturalist Cathy Meyer for a morning of birding\, citizen
  science\, and discovery during an October Big Day hike in partnership wit
 h Indiana Audubon and the Indiana Land Protection Alliance. Sign up today 
 to explore the rich biodiversity of Beanblossom Bottoms Nature Preserve an
 d help collect data on the preserve&#8217\;s avian visitors. Join us on t
 he preserve for an extraordinary October Big Day celebrating our feathery 
 friends!
