DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T123000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20261122T045959Z;BYDAY=SA
DTSTAMP:20260411T143025Z
UID:505uk70k9nds61ttlo9ea2kj6b@google.com
CREATED:20251223T163852Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <a href="https://bloomington.in.gov/farmers-market">Bloo
 mington Community Farmers' Market</a> takes place rain or shine every Satur
 day\, April through October\, at <a href="https://bloomington.in.gov/city/s
 howers-city-hall"><u>Showers Common next to City Hall</u></a>\, 401 N. Mort
 on St. in Bloomington.</p><p>April-September: 8 a.m.-12:30 p.m.<br>October:
  9 a.m.-12:30 p.m.<br>November: 9 a.m.-12:30 p.m. at the Pavilion at <a hre
 f="https://switchyardpark.com/"><u>Switchyard Park</u></a></p><p>The Market
  is a gathering place where local farmers\, makers\, and neighbors come tog
 ether to share the foods\, traditions\, and connections that strengthen our
  community and support a reliable local food supply.</p><p>Market goers fin
 d a wide assortment of goods from the farm and field\, including fruits and
  vegetables\, eggs\, meats and cheeses\, honey\, seasonal flowers\, and ann
 ual and perennial plants. Food and beverage artisans provide a tasteful var
 iety of drinks\, pastries\, and savory dishes. This weekly gathering provid
 es opportunities for individuals to connect with their community in meaning
 ful ways and support local farmers and small businesses.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251223T163852Z
LOCATION:Switchyard Park\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington\, IN 47403\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomington Community Farmers' Market
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
